note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note The epilogue of one tile row of the general GEMM (CUDApp#144, src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c l.428-439, store_c):
note v = alpha * a (a = 0 + P for one k part, else the k-part sum; the host recompute where flagged), plus beta * C
note when beta != 0 (a NaN beta counts), stored as f32, or RNE bf16 / f16 through the f64 to f32 round to odd.
note q: 0 nc (<= 4096), 1 c_type, 2 compute, 3 one part, 4 alpha f64 bits, 5 beta f64 bits. c holds the nc stored C
note elements of the row (the C shell copies them in and out); pv the nc P bits (binary32). Gives the elements recomputed (host_fixed).

note the compute part of element j
fn gx_ea q view ulong 8 pv view uchar 65536 acc view ulong 4096 fix view ulong 4096 bad view uchar 4096 j ulong to f64
if eq get q 2 0
ret bitcast f64 ulong 0
end
a = bitcast f64 get acc j
if ne get q 3 0
a = add bitcast f64 ulong 0 f64 bitcast f32 gx_get view pv j 4
end
if ne get bad j 0
a = bitcast f64 get fix j
end
ret mul bitcast f64 get q 4 a
end

note the beta term and the store of element j
fn gx_eb q view ulong 8 c edit uchar 65536 j ulong v f64 to void
ct = get q 1
es = gx_es ct
w = v
bt = bitcast f64 get q 5
if ne bt bitcast f64 ulong 0
w = add w mul bt f64 gx_ldf ct gx_get view c j es
end
u = bitcast uint f32 w
if eq ct 1
u = gx_f2bf bitcast uint gx_d2fo w
end
if eq ct 2
u = gx_f2h bitcast uint gx_d2fo w
end
gx_put edit c j es u
end

fn gemm_ex_epi q view ulong 8 pv view uchar 65536 acc view ulong 4096 fix view ulong 4096 bad view uchar 4096 c edit uchar 65536 to ulong
n = ulong 0
for j ulong get q 0
gx_eb view q edit c j gx_ea view q view pv view acc view fix view bad j
if ne get q 2 0
if ne get bad j 0
n = add n 1
end
end
end
ret n
end
